Modification statement (Section 3(c)(i)):

We have modified the TABPFN-3.5 Model. This distribution is a Derivative of TABPFN-3.5 (checkpoint
tabpfn-v3.5-20260909): the two weight files in this distribution were fine-tuned from the TABPFN-3.5 weights for 800
steps on synthetic missing-data tasks, and the code in weightedpfn/ changes the TABPFN-3.5 attention and
column preprocessing at run time so that training rows can carry sample weights.

