Modifications: the WeightedPFN authors reimplemented ICLAttention.forward, _chunked_class_attention and
TabPFNV3p5._preprocess_raw (including the empirical-CDF context built by _build_ecdf_context) so that training rows can
carry sample weights, through an additive log-weight attention bias and weighted column statistics. The modified
functions replace the originals at run time; the installed tabpfn package itself is not changed.

